+### §5 · #2 / M39 — AIKit: potency
+
+AIKit holds what a Life can know, express, reach and bring to bear, including what is absent, unavailable, unresolved or still becoming possible. The distinction between a resource’s existence, availability, relevance, permission, selection and operation must remain active. A model’s capability, a skill a person has developed, a tool that exists elsewhere and a permission granted here cannot substitute for one another. Potency is a horizon of possible determination, not an inventory whose entries are already acts.
+
+The whole **L2 Logical × L3′ Chronological** pair gives this horizon both articulation and development. Tetralemmaic ground, IS, IS-NOT, BOTH, NEITHER and SILENCE retain what is asserted, excluded, co-present, indeterminate and not yet articulated. Spirit, Spring, Summer, Autumn, Winter and Life/Aufhebung disclose arising, maturation, exercise, withdrawal, retention and transformed return. Capacities change through time; the logical field is not the temporal sequence itself, and neither is identical with dia/syn.
+
+The judgment-field described under Actuation changes when a means becomes available or ceases to be permitted. AIKit must make that difference expressible before it is silently absorbed into a selected output. Context, model access, skills, knowledge routes, interfaces, sessions and communication pathways enter this product’s technological inquiry through this operation. MEF refraction can alter what is relevant without manufacturing a new source or declaring every registered capacity presently operative.
+
+Power is lived here as the horizon of what can be attempted or communicated. Who can grant a capacity, withhold it, make its conditions visible or contest its absence matters before any final decision is scored. The returned act can reveal a missing or unsuitable means, revising the next horizon rather than only blaming the actor for a result. Factory receives that disclosed difference as a possibility for transformation.
+
+### §5 · #3 / M40 — Software Factory: transformation
+
+Software Factory holds the becoming through which intention enters action, action encounters actuality, experience becomes learning and learning changes form. A desired possibility gathers existing forms and heterogeneous materials, is composed and tested, reaches a determinate result and passes into the conditions of further becoming. The product’s software office makes this relation durable enough that development can understand and revise its own course.
+
+The whole **L3 Processual × L2′ Alchemical-Elemental** pair gives this movement its different respects. Concrescent desire, Actual occasion, Ingression, Eternal objects, Community integration and Satisfaction/Perishing name the lure, gathering, ingress of possibility, conditioning forms, encounter with a wider community and achieved occasion becoming past. Aether, Earth, Water, Air, Fire and Salt disclose field, matter, flow, mediation, energetic transformation and precipitated result. These are the retained authored lens contents; their source relations do not license attributing the entire product design to Whitehead or an undifferentiated alchemical tradition.
+
+The preference baseline and model trace developed in Actuation enter Factory as evidence to assess, not self-authorising verdicts. A successful local operation can still fail to serve its originating intention or wider world. Development therefore needs a recoverable relation between intention, attempt, actual consequence, review, acceptance and changed ground. The history of an occasion must allow failure and contradiction to alter what is tried next, rather than making polished output the proof that its intention was fulfilled.
+
+A/C’s entrusted power and apportionment become practical here: who commissions a change, whose labour and sources it uses, who can accept it, who bears its costs and what experience can reopen it? The inherited Power and Antichrist field keeps the darkness of captured creative power visible in its historical and mythic specificity. No generic responsible-technology gloss replaces that inquiry. Workcell receives the transformed possibility where a result must exist, resist and be encountered.
+
+### §5 · #4 / M41 — Workcell: situated existence
+
+Workcell holds the concrete here through which a Life finds itself in a World, susceptible to its conditions and available within it to others. Situated existence is not an abstract agent plus a later location. It includes being thrown into circumstances, acting through a bounded aperture, meeting bodily and material resistance, and becoming encounterable. A host, VM, process, network, filesystem, browser or service matters insofar as it gives technological activity these determinate conditions; naming an execution substrate alone does not discharge the philosophical office.
+
+The whole **L4 Phenomenological × L1′ Phenomenal** pair discloses Being, Thrownness, Being-there, Temporality, Care and Releasement with Introversion, Sensation, Feeling, Thinking, Intuition and Extroversion. The first gives a situated life’s involvement and capacity to release its present grasp; the second articulates its aperture toward itself and world. Their technological comparison concerns organised access, resistance and encounter. Functional reports and a phenomenal attribution remain separately warranted.
+
+The designed atlas and dynamic world-field developed under Actuation acquire an actual trial here. A chart, observation or prediction meets something that can differ from it; the difference must be able to return to the field and the next act. Workcell’s endpoint is also another actor’s encounter region. The same situation which permits an agency to act makes it available to be addressed and affected, carrying A27’s Self/Other relation and A30’s co-internality into concrete conditions.
+
+The Power argument reaches daily life through this material situation: what can be seen, said, remembered, attempted and contested; whose intention takes effect; who controls the means; who bears time, energy and bodily costs; and whether returned experience can revise those conditions. Tools help build the surrounding world, becoming the air we breathe even when it appears to be getting thin. The next product makes the containing relations of these situated worlds explicit without inventing an absolute exterior.
+
